  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Elementary Education Program.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Programa Educacion Primaria.</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">THE PROGRAM WOULD SUPPORT ACTIVITIES TO INCREMENT LEVELS OF LEARNING AND ACCESS OF THE MORE DISADVANTAGED CHILDREN IN THE FORMAL BASIC EDUCATION SYSTEM; ELIMINATE THROUGH A NON SCHOLASTIC INITIAL EDUCATION PROGRAM THE VICISSITUDES FACED BY INFANTS OF ILLITERATE PARENTS; AND TO PROVIDE ACCESS TO COMMUNITY EDUCATION TO SMALL ISOLATED COMMUNITIES THAT LACK FORMAL SCHOOLS, IN SEVEN STATES THAT SHOW A GREATER EDUCATIONAL DISADVANTAGE.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES"></narrative>
  </description>
